    Sublayer:
    Request router
    Sublayer:
    API versioning
    Sublayer:
    Load balancer

Layer:
Core Banking
    Sublayer:
    Account management
    Sublayer:
    Transaction engine
    Sublayer:
    Transfer processor
    Sublayer:
    Balance calculator
    Sublayer:
    Statement generator

Layer:
Lending
    Sublayer:
    Loan origination
    Sublayer:
    Credit scoring
    Sublayer:
    Payment scheduling
    Sublayer:
    Collateral management

Layer:
Fraud Detection
    Sublayer:
    Real-time monitoring
    Sublayer:
    Pattern analysis
    Sublayer:
    Alert management
    Sublayer:
    Case investigation

Layer:
Integration
    Sublayer:
    Payment network SWIFT
    Sublayer:
    Card network Visa Mastercard
    Sublayer:
